                                "sense_id": "667fe2d6-2f25-3efa-b99c-8d882ad3f625",
                                "text": "Given the challenges of trying to propagate avocados, one might wonder why we don't simply get hold of seeds and/or nursery starts and go that route – especially since avos tend to grow somewhat 'true to seed.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8e5bfbb-f733-47a9-a4c4-bd035f2b1d03",
                                "sense_id": "667fe2d6-2f25-3efa-b99c-8d882ad3f625",
                                "text": "But what would my trip be if I didn’t Instagram my food? I upload a picture of the avo toast with the caption “✨✨✨one of the prettiest red velvet rose latte i’ve ever seen !!! ✨✨✨✨ , despite the fact I have only ever seen one red velvet rose latte in my life."
                            }
                        ]
